      "raw_text": "The Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH) reopened the EDSA-Ortigas Interchange to light vehicles early Monday morning after completing clearing and clean-up operations over the weekend.\n\nThe EDSA-Ortigas Interchange was opened to traffic at 4 a.m. of April 27.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/kQIDyY7Hsj",
      "cleaned_text": "The Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH) reopened the EDSA-Ortigas Interchange to light vehicles early Monday morning after completing clearing and clean-up operations over the weekend. The EDSA-Ortigas Interchange was opened to traffic at 4 a.m. of April 27. Read more:",
